  "collision": "All Col_ meshes are hidden from Blender renders; Unity strips renderers and creates MeshColliders. Col_Ground top=-0.03m. The HQ body and plinth, clinic, market, workshop and booths (1.2 m counters), the kiosk, barricades, planters, benches, trunks and the fountain collide; the plaza boundary walls are 1.2 m high. Roads, lamps, cars, bushes, signs and the skyline are visual only. Colliders north-east of the player stay low so the follow camera (offset +10 x, +14 y, +12 z) is not pulled in. Tripo pieces: HQ body, canopy columns and the 0.29 m doorway landing (Col_HQ_Stoop) replace the HQ plinth colliders; the Tripo fountain keeps Col_Fountain.",
  "doors": "HQ entrance (Tripo HQ): doorway x -3.2..3.1 on a 0.29 m landing (Col_HQ_Stoop), Spot_elder in the doorway, Spot_guild_clerk on the paving behind the kiosk. Gate pocket: barricades at y -16.2 from x -21 to the HQ west wall close it; Spot_gate stands in front at y -15.",
